# Blazor Frontend

Before editing `.razor` files, read [docs/agents/core/blazor-patterns.md](../../docs/agents/core/blazor-patterns.md).

**Mandatory:** `SecurePageBase` + `OnPageInitializedAsync()`; `ApiService` for HTTP; `SessionStateService` for session; `NavigationManager` for navigation. No HTML SPA, sessionStorage, raw HttpClient, or hardcoded API URLs.
